{"id":"n13967-1-7","stage":2,"title":"시아버지 · 公公","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n13967-1-7-1","ko":"시아버지와 시어머니는 어디 가셨니?","zh":"您公公和婆婆去哪儿了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시아버지와","meaning":"公公","explanation":"시아버지：公公；와：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"시아버지","audio":"/audio/1cbf2b22367438527022.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13967","senseId":"1","lemma":"시아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시어머니는","meaning":"婆婆","explanation":"시어머니：婆婆；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"시어머니","audio":"/audio/dd81d91b759e9ad31911.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65293","senseId":"1","lemma":"시어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가셨니?","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1cbf2b2236743852","term":"시아버지","zh":"公公","audio":"/audio/1cbf2b22367438527022.mp3","entryId":"13967","definition":"丈夫的父亲。","pronunciation":["시아버지"]},{"id":"dd81d91b759e9ad3","term":"시어머니","zh":"婆婆","audio":"/audio/dd81d91b759e9ad31911.mp3","entryId":"65293","definition":"丈夫的母亲。","pronunciation":["시어머니"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ce0efc391e34a5c99abd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n13967-1-7-2","ko":"네, 두 분이서 제주도로 여행을 가셨어요.","zh":"是的，他们两个人一起去济州岛旅行了。","note":